  display-inside
    defined-by pattern
    role source-owned-read-form
    example "Show me what is inside nested/Example.rs at the top."
    precondition "the complete display-inside form owns one typed local source operand; unbound prerequisites, additional goals and literal payload quotations remain outside this authority"
    effect "binds the source operand for the existing Full Read producer; positional wording does not certify a first-line-only result or transport completion"
    unit "one source operand and complete request frame"
    grounding "existing modePathsForClause, mode_paths_for_clause and modeForPrompt Full producers; original dotted-file capability test"
    lexeme en "show contents inside a source file"
    lexeme ru "показать содержимое исходного файла"
    lexeme hi "स्रोत फ़ाइल की सामग्री दिखाएं"
    lexeme zh "显示源文件中的内容"
    lexeme es "mostrar contenido dentro de un archivo fuente"
